{
  "info": {
    "name": "Presence Platform — Core API (EN/ES)",
    "description": "Presence Platform core backend. Bilingual (EN/ES) API collection.\n\nPlataforma de Presencia — backend central. Colección bilingüe (EN/ES).\n\nHOW TO USE / CÓMO USAR:\n1. Run `php artisan migrate --seed` — the seeder PRINTS the credential_uids and reader api_keys to the console.\n2. Set the collection variables below (classroom_reader_key, recycling_reader_key, credential_uid) to the printed values.\n\nAUTH PATTERNS:\n- Device endpoints (tap, classify): header `Authorization: Bearer <reader.api_key>`\n- Admin/teacher endpoints (mode, redeem, nl-query): log in via the dashboard (session cookie) or use a personal access token.\n\nToday (default) is filled with the Postman `{{$timestamp}}` where useful.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "classroom_reader_key",
      "value": "PASTE_FROM_SEEDER_OUTPUT"
    },
    {
      "key": "recycling_reader_key",
      "value": "PASTE_FROM_SEEDER_OUTPUT"
    },
    {
      "key": "credential_uid",
      "value": "PASTE_FROM_SEEDER_OUTPUT"
    },
    {
      "key": "student_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "reward_id",
      "value": "3"
    },
    {
      "key": "reader_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "event_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_pat",
      "value": "OPTIONAL_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN"
    },
    {
      "key": "new_credential_uid",
      "value": "NEWCARD000001",
      "description": "A fresh card UID to pair / Un UID de tarjeta nueva para emparejar"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{classroom_reader_key}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 Device — Tap (Classroom) / Dispositivo — Tap (Aula)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{classroom_reader_key}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept-Language",
            "value": "en"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"credential_uid\": \"{{credential_uid}}\",\n  \"client_timestamp\": null\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/events/tap",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "events",
            "tap"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Phase B — the core presence loop.\n\nSend the card's credential_uid; the reader is identified by its Bearer key (never trust a client-supplied reader ID).\n\nResponse 200: { status, event_id, event_type, student_first_name, next_step }\nResponse 401: invalid/missing Bearer token.\nResponse 404: card not recognized / not active.\n\nTip: set Accept-Language: es to receive Spanish messages."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "02 Device — Tap (Recycling) / Dispositivo — Tap (Reciclaje)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{recycling_reader_key}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"credential_uid\": \"{{credential_uid}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/events/tap",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "events",
            "tap"
          ]
        },
        "description": "A recycling tap only logs the event; points are awarded AFTER classification. next_step = \"awaiting_classification\" — take event_id for the classify call."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "03 Device — Classify + Earn / Dispositivo — Clasificar + Ganar",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{recycling_reader_key}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "event_id",
              "value": "{{event_id}}",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "image",
              "type": "file",
              "src": []
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/recycling/classify",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "recycling",
            "classify"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Phase C — multipart: event_id + image file (any test image works for the contract). Idempotent: re-submitting the same event_id does NOT double-award points.\n\nResponse 200: { status, already_classified, material_class, confidence, points_awarded, new_balance }\nPoints table (config/recycling.php): plastic=10, paper=5, metal=15, glass=8, other=0."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "04 Admin — Change reader mode / Cambiar modo del lector",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{admin_pat}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"active_event_type\": \"PAE_LUNCH\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/readers/{{reader_id}}/mode",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "admin",
            "readers",
            "{{reader_id}}",
            "mode"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Phase B — relabel a reader (CLASS_ATTENDANCE / PAE_BREAKFAST / PAE_LUNCH / RECYCLING_DEPOSIT / ENTRY). Admin-only (403 for teachers, 401 for guests). PUT works too."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "05 Desk — Redeem reward / Canjear recompensa",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{admin_pat}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"reward_id\": {{reward_id}}\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/students/{{student_id}}/redeem",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "students",
            "{{student_id}}",
            "redeem"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Phase D — the spend half of the loop. Admin or teacher.\n\nResponse 200: { status, student_id, reward, new_balance, ledger_id }\nResponse 422: insufficient points, includes current_balance + shortfall."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "05b Desk — Redemption failure example / Ejemplo de fallo",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{admin_pat}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"reward_id\": 1\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/students/{{student_id}}/redeem",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "students",
            "{{student_id}}",
            "redeem"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Redeem the 50-point 'Canteen discount voucher' with a low balance to see the clean 422 + shortfall."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "06 Admin — NL query / Consulta en lenguaje natural",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{admin_pat}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"How many students attended class today, 2026-09-02?\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/nl-query",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "nl-query"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Phase E — Gemini function-calling; the LLM only SELECTS functions, the backend computes the real answer.\n\nResponse 200: { status, answer, functions_called }\nResponse 503: { status: 'blocked', blocked_reason } when no GEMINI_API_KEY is configured (honest blocker, not a fake answer)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "08 Admin — Arm card pairing / Armar emparejamiento",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{admin_pat}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept-Language",
            "value": "en"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/students/{{student_id}}/arm-pairing",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "admin",
            "students",
            "{{student_id}}",
            "arm-pairing"
          ]
        },
        "description": "TASK-010 — step 1 of card pairing: arm a short-lived pending pairing (45 s window) for a student. Admin session or personal access token.\n\nResponse 200: { status, student_id, expires_at }\nResponse 401/403: guest / non-admin.\nResponse 404: unknown student.\n\nTip: set Accept-Language: es to receive Spanish messages."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "09 Device — Pair card / Emparejar tarjeta",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{classroom_reader_key}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept-Language",
            "value": "en"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"credential_uid\": \"{{new_credential_uid}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/cards/pair",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "admin",
            "cards",
            "pair"
          ]
        },
        "description": "TASK-010 — step 2 of card pairing: submit a freshly scanned card UID. Auth is the READER Bearer key (same as the tap endpoint), not a user token.\n\nResponse 200: { status, paired_student_name, student_id } — the card works immediately for taps.\nResponse 409: no pairing session active (none armed / expired / consumed).\nResponse 422: card already paired (never reassigned).\nResponse 401: missing/invalid reader key.\n\nTip: set Accept-Language: es to receive Spanish messages."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "07 Health / Salud",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/up",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "up"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Laravel health check endpoint."
      }
    }
  ]
}
